<title>AUSTRALIA: Hills Motorway says 45,000 cars used M2.</title>
<headline>Hills Motorway says 45,000 cars used M2.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hills Motorway Group said 45,437 vehicles used the M2 Motorway in Sydney in the first twenty four hours of operation.</p>
<p>The 21 km toll motorway, in Sydney's northwest, opened on Monday.</p>
<p>A one-way journey toll is A$2.50.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
